      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "What it could be is that in game someone can turn on an option to show avatars that bypass limitations. So in the sdk it knows if the avatar is let’s say over the poly limit. Then you have a check box to let the sdk know you wish to bypass the limits. I know this can still cause problems because now crashers can upload avatars without a modded sdk or something. And it would need a lot of adjustments but it could work. Also sorry for the bad English it may be a little hard to read but I think it gets the point across.",
